---
source: crates/telec-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: extracted
---
  list            List roadmap entries (source of truth for todo status)
  add             Add an entry to the roadmap
  remove          Remove an entry from the roadmap
  move            Reorder an entry in the roadmap
  deps            Set dependencies for an entry
  freeze          Move an entry to the icebox
  unfreeze        Promote an entry from the icebox to the active roadmap
  migrate-icebox  Migrate v1 icebox folders into `todos/_icebox/` (deferred to v1)
  deliver         Mark an entry as delivered
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
